WEBVTT

00:00:02.326 --> 00:00:09.200
Anthony and the others found out about
Neil and Eliza's ploy to send Candy to Mexico.

00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:15.684
Aunt Elroy was supposed to find out
the truth in the morning.

00:00:16.298 --> 00:00:21.921
However,
the escort from Mexico turned up early.

00:00:22.521 --> 00:00:25.978
And so, Candy departed to distant Mexico

00:00:26.013 --> 00:00:29.555
...without even saying goodbye
to Anthony and others.

00:00:30.192 --> 00:00:34.566
On the distant, dry wastelands.

00:00:46.592 --> 00:00:48.621
I've come this far already.

00:00:49.435 --> 00:00:51.106
There's no way I could turn back now.

00:00:52.135 --> 00:00:55.075
If I had wings, I'd fly back
as fast as I could.

00:00:55.789 --> 00:00:57.249
Back to Anthony's place.

00:01:07.304 --> 00:01:09.882
Alright! We'll take a rest there.

00:01:21.084 --> 00:01:21.899
Wait!

00:01:22.576 --> 00:01:28.364
Until we get to Mexico, remember that
I'm the master and you're just a servant!

00:01:36.435 --> 00:01:37.751
I'm hungry as hell.

00:01:42.246 --> 00:01:43.057
Kurin!

00:01:44.677 --> 00:01:45.746
Here you go.

00:01:46.613 --> 00:01:48.825
I forgot something else.

00:01:53.225 --> 00:01:54.019
Alright.

00:01:56.960 --> 00:01:58.632
Damn it!

00:02:00.124 --> 00:02:02.164
Haven't I told you not to
waste water?

00:02:02.199 --> 00:02:03.951
And on such a thing!

00:02:10.059 --> 00:02:11.296
Sweet Candy is...

00:02:12.168 --> 00:02:13.960
We're not on a picnic!

00:02:14.674 --> 00:02:17.820
What's with that flower?
It has no use!

00:02:18.413 --> 00:02:22.836
From now on, every one of us gets
only one cup of water per day!

00:02:23.715 --> 00:02:26.368
Then, it's okay to water the
rose from my part?

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:28.974
Yeah.
It's your raccoon's part, too.

00:02:29.581 --> 00:02:31.082
His part, too?

00:02:32.015 --> 00:02:34.954
If you have a problem with that, dump
the raccoon and the rose here.

00:03:36.493 --> 00:03:38.214
Hey, a farm!

00:03:40.283 --> 00:03:42.076
Yes, that's where we were going.

00:03:42.115 --> 00:03:45.327
Thank god! We'll get all the water
we need here!

00:03:46.827 --> 00:03:49.079
The millet has all dried up!

00:03:49.191 --> 00:03:52.185
Yeah, it hasn't rained in
a very long time.

00:03:52.220 --> 00:03:53.515
It's a disaster.

00:03:53.905 --> 00:03:55.650
It hasn't rained...?

00:03:55.685 --> 00:03:57.783
Nothing ever comes from the clouds!

00:03:58.110 --> 00:03:59.997
This place is totally dead!

00:04:00.565 --> 00:04:01.499
Kurin!

00:04:16.588 --> 00:04:20.567
Do you understand now?
Water isn't important to you alone.

00:04:21.310 --> 00:04:26.042
Hey, Walther!
Walther, I've come to pick you up!

00:04:26.077 --> 00:04:28.567
Yeah, I'll be there in a second!

00:04:37.071 --> 00:04:40.479
Now, say farewell to grandpa
and grandma.

00:04:50.789 --> 00:04:52.903
What is going to happen to them?

00:04:53.401 --> 00:04:55.889
They are going to work in
the fields, just like you.

00:04:56.303 --> 00:04:58.169
Like me?

00:04:58.204 --> 00:05:01.052
Yeah. That's what the
family sent you for.

00:05:01.268 --> 00:05:03.118
That's not what I've been told.

00:05:03.153 --> 00:05:05.143
You must be forgetting things!

00:05:13.474 --> 00:05:15.011
Who'd think that there
are things like this.

00:05:15.723 --> 00:05:20.211
I might have been living in the barn,
but I've always had plenty to eat.

00:05:27.223 --> 00:05:28.587
Now, let's go.

00:05:41.810 --> 00:05:44.901
So you're going to Mexico as well?

00:05:44.936 --> 00:05:49.356
But... if you don't want to go to Mexico,
aren't there some other places you could work?

00:05:50.504 --> 00:05:53.935
I guess you don't know how
hard life can be, right?

00:05:54.280 --> 00:05:56.064
Hard life?

00:05:56.277 --> 00:05:59.117
Why are you going to Mexico?

00:05:59.775 --> 00:06:01.544
I didn't want to go.

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:03.603
But I couldn't help it.

00:06:04.011 --> 00:06:05.546
Just like us.

00:06:06.398 --> 00:06:07.478
We couldn't help it.

00:06:07.968 --> 00:06:11.392
But isn't there a way for us
to quit this job?

00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:13.393
You can't do that.

00:06:13.965 --> 00:06:14.974
Why?

00:06:15.554 --> 00:06:18.875
I lent money to this family.

00:06:18.910 --> 00:06:21.316
That's the sole reason they didn't
go broke until today!

00:06:21.724 --> 00:06:24.792
And now I'm taking them back to
Mexico until they pay off their debt!

00:07:08.660 --> 00:07:11.413
I wish this rain had come
a bit earlier!

00:07:35.818 --> 00:07:38.395
Those are cowboys, right?
They're cool!

00:07:47.373 --> 00:07:49.091
Water, it's water!

00:07:49.126 --> 00:07:50.847
Alright, we'll set up
a camp here!

00:07:58.520 --> 00:08:00.441
Why, what a cute calf!

00:08:00.476 --> 00:08:02.278
Probably belongs to those
cowboys.

00:08:02.515 --> 00:08:05.676
You got separated from your mama?
Hello!

00:08:07.645 --> 00:08:11.263
Alright, I'll catch it!
Otherwise jackals will get to it first.

00:08:11.672 --> 00:08:12.732
Jackals?

00:08:13.832 --> 00:08:14.785
Just a moment!

00:08:14.820 --> 00:08:15.872
Hey, what are you doing?

00:08:15.907 --> 00:08:17.217
I'll catch it!

00:08:19.050 --> 00:08:21.627
Stand still!

00:08:33.622 --> 00:08:35.961
Hey, Candy, you got it!

00:08:36.582 --> 00:08:39.623
Let me borrow your horse.
I'll return this calf.

00:08:39.789 --> 00:08:41.831
There'll be no need for that.

00:08:42.274 --> 00:08:45.623
We found it, so we'll take
it with ourselves.

00:08:45.885 --> 00:08:47.520
You can't do that!

00:08:47.555 --> 00:08:49.679
You don't really get it?

00:08:50.187 --> 00:08:53.836
It's best for a child to
stay next to its mama!

00:08:53.871 --> 00:08:55.571
I won't let you take it!

00:08:55.606 --> 00:08:57.280
You got some nerve!

00:08:57.519 --> 00:08:59.233
What are you doing to her?

00:08:59.382 --> 00:09:02.514
What? Are you talking to me?

00:09:03.124 --> 00:09:07.897
If I hadn't taken you, you'd be
starving in your house right now!

00:09:09.881 --> 00:09:11.590
I'll take this calf.

00:09:17.291 --> 00:09:18.324
What's the matter?

00:09:18.757 --> 00:09:20.823
Is that calf yours?

00:09:21.042 --> 00:09:22.961
This calf, of course!

00:09:22.996 --> 00:09:24.129
It is yours!

00:09:25.733 --> 00:09:27.292
I knew it!

00:09:28.055 --> 00:09:30.512
I was going to bring it
to you!

00:09:31.359 --> 00:09:33.135
Thank you, miss!

00:09:33.170 --> 00:09:36.072
-See you then!
-Don't separate it from mama!

00:09:36.922 --> 00:09:38.320
This runt...!

00:09:38.574 --> 00:09:39.390
Stop that!

00:09:40.699 --> 00:09:44.210
You know that penalty for cattle
stealing is death by hanging?

00:09:44.735 --> 00:09:47.033
Candy just saved you.

00:09:49.902 --> 00:09:51.898
Mr. Walther, thank you.

00:09:52.028 --> 00:09:54.782
No problem. Now, gather some firewood.

00:09:55.934 --> 00:09:56.756
Okay!

00:10:12.421 --> 00:10:15.357
Hey, why don't you give some
to your brother, too?

00:10:15.392 --> 00:10:16.815
Oh, come on!

00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:18.725
No, no!

00:10:20.620 --> 00:10:21.827
Come on!

00:10:21.862 --> 00:10:22.800
Don't do that!

00:10:29.247 --> 00:10:30.875
Calm down!

00:10:31.876 --> 00:10:33.544
I'll tuck you in.

00:10:36.171 --> 00:10:38.431
Mama put her baby in the basket...

00:10:40.922 --> 00:10:44.605
Sister Pony, sister Lane,
where is my mama?

00:10:46.344 --> 00:10:50.263
Candy, I and sister Pony
are your mamas.

00:10:50.276 --> 00:10:53.069
You were born in that basket.

00:10:53.104 --> 00:10:55.555
And then you were given
to Pony's home!

00:10:59.419 --> 00:11:00.529
What's the matter?

00:11:02.647 --> 00:11:05.046
Shut up!
Make it stop crying!

00:11:05.463 --> 00:11:08.466
I'm sorry.
Please sleep.

00:11:08.501 --> 00:11:12.391
Bear through this.
Your mother doesn't have milk for you.

00:11:13.106 --> 00:11:17.297
So that's it...
I'll make it quiet!

00:11:17.401 --> 00:11:18.323
Wait!

00:11:19.426 --> 00:11:21.459
What? Move it!

00:11:21.727 --> 00:11:23.983
Let me handle this.

00:11:25.964 --> 00:11:28.709
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
The Mexican guy is almost completely unintelligible.
This really urinates me off!

00:11:32.289 --> 00:11:37.163
That's funny. If you don't make it
quiet, I'll go nasty on you this time.

00:11:37.416 --> 00:11:38.570
Just a moment!

00:11:40.886 --> 00:11:42.310
I'll borrow it for a minute!

00:11:42.807 --> 00:11:45.050
Hey! What are you doing with my horse?

00:11:55.310 --> 00:11:56.040
Who is it?

00:11:57.446 --> 00:11:58.689
Good evening!

00:11:59.500 --> 00:12:00.827
You are...

00:12:01.282 --> 00:12:04.225
I'm Candy.
Candice White.

00:12:04.794 --> 00:12:06.989
Are you alone? This late?

00:12:07.174 --> 00:12:10.512
I came to ask you for a favor.
Can you help me?

00:12:11.039 --> 00:12:11.961
What is it?

00:12:12.439 --> 00:12:14.755
Could you fill this with milk?

00:12:16.621 --> 00:12:18.518
You came just for that?

00:12:18.975 --> 00:12:22.565
Yeah, that's right!
You have so many cows...

00:12:28.805 --> 00:12:32.218
Candy, be careful!
Jim will take you back to your camp.

00:12:32.415 --> 00:12:34.718
Thank you for giving me this much!

00:12:38.889 --> 00:12:40.232
Well, now.

00:12:43.858 --> 00:12:45.975
Candy, thank you.

00:12:46.443 --> 00:12:47.612
Let me.

00:13:22.226 --> 00:13:24.961
Stop the carriage!

00:13:26.977 --> 00:13:28.674
The baby has a fever!

00:13:29.415 --> 00:13:31.473
If we don't get to the doctor soon...

00:13:31.776 --> 00:13:34.563
You'll have to bear it
until we get to the next town.

00:13:34.785 --> 00:13:36.184
How much until next town?

00:13:36.662 --> 00:13:38.435
Around one day maybe.

00:13:38.470 --> 00:13:39.672
That much?

00:13:39.707 --> 00:13:42.270
Wouldn't it be faster if we just
returned to the town we passed before?

00:13:42.305 --> 00:13:43.555
You're kidding me!

00:13:43.784 --> 00:13:47.158
If we return to that town, we'll
turn up late in Mexico.

00:13:47.559 --> 00:13:50.226
Will there be enough time
for doctor to see the baby?

00:13:50.261 --> 00:13:51.862
I don't know that!

00:13:52.109 --> 00:13:56.168
It depends on many things. That's why
it's better to stop in the next town.

00:13:57.412 --> 00:14:00.411
Then, you're saying that it doesn't
matter what happens to the baby?

00:14:00.446 --> 00:14:05.754
Death is a part of life, too!
There is no way we're heading back now!

00:14:05.789 --> 00:14:07.460
These are my ways!

00:14:08.725 --> 00:14:10.777
What a cold person!

00:14:12.612 --> 00:14:16.137
Please, at least stop the carriage
until we give medicine to the baby!

00:14:16.172 --> 00:14:17.294
At least do that!

00:14:18.526 --> 00:14:21.536
I understand. Better do it now.

00:14:27.227 --> 00:14:29.841
No good, baby spit out everything.

00:14:29.876 --> 00:14:31.434
That medicine doesn't work!

00:14:31.492 --> 00:14:32.180
Shut up!

00:14:32.215 --> 00:14:33.370
Hold still.

00:14:41.780 --> 00:14:42.696
Okay.

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:50.443
Where are you going?!

00:14:51.026 --> 00:14:52.688
We're going back!

00:14:53.057 --> 00:14:57.022
What are you doing, you idiot?
Come back here, Candy!

00:14:57.397 --> 00:15:00.335
You're going to leave me here?!

00:15:10.313 --> 00:15:12.229
You did a terrible thing.

00:15:12.264 --> 00:15:13.722
There was nothing else I could do!

00:15:14.122 --> 00:15:18.165
Thank you, Candy!
You're a brave girl.

00:15:18.200 --> 00:15:18.994
Darling!

00:15:19.029 --> 00:15:19.758
What's the matter?

00:15:19.793 --> 00:15:21.634
The baby looks strange!

00:15:21.731 --> 00:15:23.731
Candy, please hurry!

00:15:34.575 --> 00:15:37.786
Where is the doctor?

00:15:44.637 --> 00:15:46.528
Where is the doctor?

00:15:49.921 --> 00:15:50.733
Thank you!

00:15:50.768 --> 00:15:52.259
Mr. Walther, this way!

00:15:56.709 --> 00:15:58.553
-Candy!
-Sis!

00:15:58.588 --> 00:16:00.010
Can he save Jimmy?

00:16:00.627 --> 00:16:01.831
I'm sure he can.

00:16:05.830 --> 00:16:07.888
Why didn't you come sooner?

00:16:08.097 --> 00:16:09.109
Doctor...

00:16:09.409 --> 00:16:11.226
This was unnecessary!

00:16:18.425 --> 00:16:21.227
Why, something smells great!

00:16:22.917 --> 00:16:24.295
They're late.

00:16:26.813 --> 00:16:30.624
It's this!
What a wonderful rose!

00:16:31.764 --> 00:16:37.265
Listen up, you can't take this baby
to Mexico! Baby might die if you do!

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:38.457
I understand.

00:16:39.306 --> 00:16:41.004
Mama, how is Jimmy?

00:16:41.601 --> 00:16:42.885
He's okay.

00:16:44.561 --> 00:16:45.806
Great!

00:16:47.388 --> 00:16:48.610
It's beautiful...!

00:16:54.153 --> 00:17:00.531
But we must get to Mexico. We already
spent all the money we got from mr. Garcia.

00:17:06.265 --> 00:17:10.132
There is no other way.
You and Jimmy stay here.

00:17:11.074 --> 00:17:14.581
Mr. Garcia will forgive me
when I tell him the reason.

00:17:15.007 --> 00:17:18.080
I'll work as much as I can in Mexico,
and I'll send you back the money.

00:17:18.232 --> 00:17:20.278
It seems there is no other way...

00:17:20.313 --> 00:17:23.417
Don't do that! Parents shouldn't
part their ways!

00:17:25.137 --> 00:17:30.544
Now listen me well. Jimmy is ill. Continuing
the journey would've been bad for him.

00:17:30.579 --> 00:17:34.847
In order to help Jimmy, mama will stay
here together with him.

00:17:34.882 --> 00:17:36.578
Okay? You understand me?

00:17:38.774 --> 00:17:40.231
You understand, too?

00:17:41.478 --> 00:17:44.051
I know you can bear it.

00:17:45.700 --> 00:17:46.726
It's okay.

00:17:50.123 --> 00:17:51.390
Mama!

00:18:06.381 --> 00:18:08.279
This is too cruel.

00:18:09.144 --> 00:18:12.725
Err... this rose is yours?

00:18:14.583 --> 00:18:18.863
The person who grew this rose
has a very gentle soul!

00:18:19.561 --> 00:18:20.503
Huh?

00:18:20.949 --> 00:18:24.642
I, too, have been growing
roses for a very long time.

00:18:24.677 --> 00:18:27.505
But I've never been able
to make something this pretty.

00:18:27.540 --> 00:18:31.217
Anyway... would you like to
sell it to me?

00:18:31.623 --> 00:18:33.852
No! I can't sell you this!

00:18:35.268 --> 00:18:38.467
I'd give you anything for it...

00:18:38.935 --> 00:18:41.369
Well then, take care of yourself.

00:18:41.404 --> 00:18:44.258
Please take care of the kids.

00:18:46.308 --> 00:18:49.192
If I had any money...

00:18:51.726 --> 00:18:54.784
Anthony, you'll forgive me, won't you?

00:18:55.830 --> 00:18:56.885
Mister!

00:18:57.221 --> 00:18:58.413
I'll sell you the rose!

00:18:58.686 --> 00:19:00.363
Alright! It's sold!

00:19:06.536 --> 00:19:08.623
Mama, the train is coming!

00:19:13.200 --> 00:19:15.725
Candy, doing such a thing...

00:19:15.889 --> 00:19:20.195
But I got money... now you won't have
to go to Mexico to work.

00:19:20.566 --> 00:19:22.943
But what are you going to
do about mr. Garcia?

00:19:22.989 --> 00:19:25.841
I had a good chat with that old man!

00:19:26.238 --> 00:19:29.601
I'm going to pay off your debt with
the money I got when I sold the rose!

00:19:29.636 --> 00:19:31.916
Now you don't have anything to worry about.

00:19:32.330 --> 00:19:34.335
Now, get on!

00:19:34.370 --> 00:19:35.549
Hurry, hurry!

00:19:52.158 --> 00:19:54.489
Candy is...
Dad! Candy is still on the station!

00:19:54.524 --> 00:19:55.699
Impossible!

00:19:56.813 --> 00:19:59.336
Candy... you are really...

00:19:59.726 --> 00:20:04.407
Farewell, Candy!
Thank you, Candy!

00:20:10.876 --> 00:20:15.679
Damn it! Garcia was screwed
over by such a girl...

00:20:16.111 --> 00:20:17.901
Idiot!!

00:20:28.219 --> 00:20:30.204
She... she's back.

00:20:30.239 --> 00:20:32.731
That idiot is really back!

00:20:36.257 --> 00:20:38.841
Uh... wha...

00:20:53.904 --> 00:20:57.711
It would've been better if you just ran...
why did you come back?

00:20:58.284 --> 00:21:00.529
I felt sorry for you, mr. Garcia.

00:21:01.628 --> 00:21:04.941
Come on, you don't have to be
sympathetic to me...

00:21:06.735 --> 00:21:09.782
The difficult journey continues.

00:21:09.897 --> 00:21:15.198
Candy then said to herself,
"I'll make it for sure".

00:21:15.233 --> 00:21:20.406
To be continued.
